{"entryId":"3426","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:3426:1","sourceSha256":"4b7b1d0244265df757a744e7e64b72f3045f090e8943fb7208be7a2b69b389fc","englishSha256":"2db27a47caf2cd6d69d6a3218a35801f3cccd4881d6b5424f8ad2c26e48949b7","citations":[{"id":"3426:1:link-008","he":[43,76],"en":[62,131],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Pesachim_22b.11"},"reference":"Pesachim 22b:11","assessment":"The three parallel sugyot preserve the alternate name and the exposition.","evidence":[{"reference":"Pesachim 22b:11","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Pesachim_22b.11"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Bava Kamma 41b:7","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bava_Kamma_41b.7"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Kiddushin 57a:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Kiddushin_57a.1"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"3426:1:link-009","he":[84,101],"en":[149,187],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Deuteronomy_10.20"},"reference":"Deuteronomy 10:20","assessment":"Deuteronomy 10:20 supplies the verse cited in the compared Megalleh Amukkot ofan. Deuteronomy 6:13 opens with identical words.","evidence":[{"reference":"Deuteronomy 10:20","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Deuteronomy_10.20"},"witness":"Miqra according to the Masorah"},{"reference":"Deuteronomy 6:13","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Deuteronomy_6.13"},"witness":"Miqra according to the Masorah"}]},{"id":"3426:1:link-010","he":[107,141],"en":[201,265],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Pesachim_22b.11"},"reference":"Pesachim 22b:11","assessment":"The primary parallels explicitly give Akiva’s interpretation.","evidence":[{"reference":"Pesachim 22b:11","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Pesachim_22b.11"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Bava Kamma 41b:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bava_Kamma_41b.8"},"witn